00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:51.579
26, 2020 there seems to be a growing number
of countries that are reporting cases and

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:56.280
within countries that have known chains of
transmission of this infection, there are

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.470
a growing number of cases in most of these
places.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:04.520
So if we're not calling this a pandemic now,
we'll likely be calling it a pandemic in the

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.530
days to come because that's exactly where
