00:02:32.129 --> 00:02:38.280
How relevant is it to look at that graphical
representation of the cases in thinking about

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.720
where this is potentially going next?

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.489
Yeah, I mean I think we have to appreciate
what the strengths are in the data and what

00:02:45.489 --> 00:02:47.830
some of the weaknesses are in the data.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:52.730
And of course we know that most of the data
