00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.859
uh, regions that have significant disease.

00:03:37.859 --> 00:03:39.430
Auron is one of them.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.139
Northern Italy is another one.

00:03:41.139 --> 00:03:45.229
And already we're starting to see exported
